WEBVTT

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:32.216
Hrabrost da stojimo
sa drugim skitnicama na ulici,

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:34.616
sa svim ubogim na zemlji,

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:37.456
da osnujemo vojsku od potrebitih,

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:41.816
s verom da smo svi goli došli na svet,

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:44.160
možemo da sagradimo bolji svet.

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:46.136
Hvala vam.

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:50.760
(Aplauz)